  "The 10.5% annual rate is an illustrative default. Enter your lender’s nominal fixed annual interest rate. CAT or APR can include other costs and should not be substituted for that rate.": "La tasa anual del 10.5% es un ejemplo. Ingresa la tasa nominal anual fija de tu crédito. El CAT y otras tasas con costos adicionales no deben sustituir esa tasa.",
  "Payment = P × r ÷ (1 − (1 + r)⁻ⁿ), where r is annual interest ÷ 12. At zero interest, the principal is divided equally over the term. A longer term lowers the payment but typically increases total interest.": "Pago = P × r ÷ (1 − (1 + r)⁻ⁿ), donde r es la tasa anual ÷ 12. Sin intereses, el capital se divide entre los meses del plazo. Un plazo mayor reduce la mensualidad, pero normalmente aumenta los intereses totales.",
